docs {
Ping manual /auth/v1/health ke Supabase dari console. Hanya admin/root.
Tanpa body - target tunggal dari env SUPABASE_URL + SUPABASE_ANON_KEY.
Hasil sinkron + INSERT baris baru ke supabase_health_checks (github_run_id='console').
Env kosong → 503 SUPABASE_PING_UNAVAILABLE.

200:

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": {
        "status": "ok",
        "http_status": 200,
        "duration_ms": 412,
        "error_message": null
      }
    }
}

meta {
  name: Trigger Supabase Ping
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/system/supabase/ping
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

tests {
  test("status 200 + envelope hasil ping", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data).to.have.property('status');
    expect(res.body.data).to.have.property('duration_ms');
  });
}
